---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = 'Terms of use — PubliTools';
const description = 'Terms of use of the PubliTools website and services.';
---
<Layout lang="en" title={title} description={description} canonical="https://publitools.ai/en/terms-of-use/" alternateUrl="https://publitools.ai/fr/cgu">
  <main class="container section-pad">
    <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-[#f4862d]">Contractual documents</p>
    <h1 class="mt-4 max-w-4xl text-5xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] text-[#262832]">Terms of use</h1>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-6 text-[#5b6170]">
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">1. Purpose</h2><p class="mt-4">These terms define the conditions of access to and use of the PubliTools website and services.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">2. Access to the service</h2><p class="mt-4">Access to certain features may require creating an account, subscribing, or validation by the publisher. The user is responsible for the confidentiality of their credentials.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">3. Authorized use</h2><p class="mt-4">The user agrees to make fair, reasonable and regulation-compliant use of the services offered. Any fraudulent, abusive, misleading use or use likely to harm the operation of the service is prohibited.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">4. Content responsibility</h2><p class="mt-4">Content, messages, visuals, descriptions, posts, reviews or any other element distributed via PubliTools remain the responsibility of the user who approves or uses them.</p><p class="mt-4">The user must verify the accuracy, compliance and suitability of content before publication.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">5. Availability</h2><p class="mt-4">The publisher strives to ensure reasonable availability of the service. However, temporary interruptions may occur for maintenance, updates, technical incidents or external constraints.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">6. Service evolution</h2><p class="mt-4">PubliTools may modify, enhance, suspend or withdraw certain features in order to evolve the product, strengthen its security or adapt it to third-party platforms and the intended professional uses.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">7. Intellectual property</h2><p class="mt-4">The elements of the site and service remain protected by applicable intellectual property rights. No right of reproduction, exploitation or reuse is granted beyond normal use of the service.</p></section>
      <section class="rounded-[16px] border border-[#e8e9ea] bg-white p-6 shadow-soft"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-[#262832]">8. Suspension and termination</h2><p class="mt-4">In the event of breach of these terms, abusive use, harm to the operation of the service or contractual default, the publisher may suspend or limit access to all or part of the service.</p></section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>